 leerling van dezelfde exclusieve school sterft, onderzoekt hij de verborgen verhoudingen onder de jongeren. Thuis zorgen hij en Rina ondertussen voor Gabe, die door zijn ouders is achtergelaten. De terugkeer van diens gevaarlijke vader maakt die verantwoordelijkheid nog onzekerder. Het verhaal verbindt zorgen om één kind met een omgeving waarin privileges niet tegen geweld beschermen.","work_id":987147041,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work6041 Gun games / Faye Kellerman; exact Dutch Bloedspel ISBN 9789402708608 Paperback. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-033.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p398124388"],"reference":"work:6041","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-033.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL16593146W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p398124388"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789402708608","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15104718,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.998Z","editionKey":"/books/OL59612890M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https